Sorry you had to find out about Green Slime the hard way.  I was
working on my first ascension and I practiced going through Gehennom in
wizard mode.  The only thing that took me out was Green Slime so I read
up on it.

If you have reflection, magic resistence, good armor, good weapons and
luck (and a way to uncurse things) I think green slime is one of the
few things that can kill you in a real fight.  There isn't any
resistence for it.  I guess that one demon prince is bad too if it gets
summoned.  But usually I have such a good AC and high level that
nothing really can touch me.  But slime still can kill you quick, even
if you don't eat it.

Obviously you could do many things to get killed if you tried (like
eating a cockatrice corpse).  But I'm just thinking of a straight
fight.  Anyway, I guess this is kind of irrelevent since you ate the
slime.  But my point is that now that you know about slime there isn't
too much else in your way.

